This repository contains the public LGPL native bridge used by the separately
distributed KMediaBridge backend. It does not contain the proprietary Kotlin
API, backend implementation, packaging policy, or product source.

The Maven artifacts depend on the separately published KMediaFfmpegRuntime and
package only the matching KMediaBridge native library and its legal metadata.
